格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh全模态工作站插件，让模型支持视频、图片、语音的输入与输出，支持comfyui图像生成工具调用。Any-to-Any.","id":"gh:1357229696","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-omni-workstation","slug":"huashenglian/dsh-omni-workstation","topics":["computer-vision","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugin-market","dsh-plugins","image-generation","multimodal-ai","omni","speech-recognition","text-to-speech","tts","video-generation","vlm"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh全模态工作站插件，让模型支持视频、图片、语音的输入与输出，支持comfyui图像生成工具调用。Any-to-Any."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-omni-workstation"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"An **omni-modal workstation plugin** for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`). It gives the AI eyes, a brush, a "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"camera and a voice: image analysis backed by an ordered multi-card VLM failover chain, a 6-tool loca"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"l vision toolkit, image generation (incl. ComfyUI workflows), multi-card async video generation with"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" an AI tool builder, and TTS / voice cloning across 3 cloud + 4 local providers — all configured fro"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"m one auto-saving settings page (English / 中文)."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Install · Quick Start · Features · Docs · How it works"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"The plugin is a **bundle**: it carries its own `cordis.patch.yml` and self-activates — one command, "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"no manual patch editing."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"`dsh plugin add` installs the dependency and appends the bundle to `dsh.profile.bundles` automatical"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"h plugin add` installs the dependency and appends the bundle to `dsh.profile.bundles` automatically."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> Do **not** add a manual `- insert: - id: omni-workstation` row to the profile `cordis.pa"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"tch.yml` — the bundle already inserts it. A second insert throws `duplicate loader entry id: omni-wo"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"rkstation` at boot.\n>\n> Manual alternative: put the package under `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/plugins/ds"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"h-omni-workstation/`, add `\"dsh-omni-workstation\": \"file:./plugins/dsh-omni-workstation\"` to the pro"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"file `package.json` dependencies and `\"dsh-omni-workstation\"` to the `dsh.profile.bundles` array, ru"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"n `pnpm install`, then restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart `dsh web` and open <http://127.0.0.1:3080>. If you don't have the `dsh` CLI yet, start the w"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"nd open <http://127.0.0.1:3080>. If you don't have the `dsh` CLI yet, start the web server directly:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- `dsh` CLI (DeepSeek Harness) with a `web` profile — or any CLI/headless profile (see CLI / headles"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"s)\n- `pnpm` on `PATH` (or use `npx --yes pnpm@<version>`)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. Restart `dsh web` and open **Settings → Omni Workstation**.\n2. On the VLM tab, click **Add Model*"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"* (or edit the default card): pick a provider, paste your API key, fetch and pick a model.\n3. Send t"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"he AI an image (or a local path) and ask about it — the `analyze_image` tool is now live."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"All settings live in **one JSON file**, `omni-vision.json`. The settings page writes it, and in a te"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"rminal-only setup it is the *only* way to configure the plugin — there are no extra slash commands t"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" setup it is the *only* way to configure the plugin — there are no extra slash commands to memorize."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**Where the file lives** (highest priority first):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| # | Path | When it is used |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| 1 | `$DSH_OMNI_WORKSTATION_CONFIG_DIR/omni-vision.json` | test / advanced override only |\n| 2 | `~"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"/.dsh/omni-vision.json` — or `$DSH_HOME/omni-vision.json` when `DSH_HOME` is set | **recommended**; "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"used whenever it exists, and the default target for a new install |\n| 3 | `~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"/node_modules/dsh-omni-workstation/omni-vision.json` | legacy location (v2.5–v2.13); still honoured "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"while no home file exists |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"On Windows: `C:\\Users\\<you>\\.dsh\\omni-vision.json`. Everything the plugin persists lives **next to t"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"hat file**: `omni-vision.json.bak` (recovery copy), `omni-vision.schema.json` (editor completion), `"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"voice-library/` (cloned voice samples) and `transcripts/` (STT output)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> [!TIP]\n> - **Hand edits apply without a restart.** The plugin re-reads the file on the next agent "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"step and re-registers tools accordingly.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Feature Overview"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Module | Tool | Highlights |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| VLM | `analyze_image` | Ordered API card list, single-request failover, per-card timeout, JPEG→PNG"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" fallback, 28 built-in providers, mirror models, dynamic multimodal adaptation |\n| Vision Toolkit | "},{"id":"p26s3","text":"`zoom_image` · `sample_colors` · `image_diff` · `ocr_image` · `detect_elements` · `show_image` | 4 t"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ools are pure-local (zero tokens); shared image resolution + card chain; artifact paths only |\n| Ima"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"ge Gen | `generate_image` | OpenAI / DashScope / ComfyUI protocols, multi-workflow management with r"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"ole mapping, reference-image support, auto verify reminder |\n| Video | `generate_video` (+ per-card "},{"id":"p26s7","text":"names) | Multi-card (limit 10), 7 protocols, `/build-video-tool` AI builder with `custom-adapter` ru"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"ntime |\n| Voice | `speak` · `clone_voice` · `transcribe` | MiMo / MiniMax / Doubao + IndexTTS / GPT-"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"SoVITS / VoxCPM / TTS-WebUI; zero-registration inline & persisted cloning; speech-to-text via one Op"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"enAI-compatible protocol (local FunASR by default, no key needed) |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Every module has its own switch (on by default, except the STT sub-switch), but a switch alone is no"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"t enough: turning one off unregisters its tools completely, and an incomplete configuration never re"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"gisters the tool at all (0 token cost) while keeping your configuration."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Why a plugin instead of a Skill or a fixed script"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Approach | Typical pain | What this plugin does |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Long Skill text (official-API recipes) | A big instruction dump every turn — expensive tokens | Co"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"nfig lives only in the settings page / `omni-vision.json`; tool schemas inject only when a module is"},{"id":"p30s3","text":" on |\n| Fixed scripts (hand-written API calls) | Locked in a project folder; you must restate path a"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"nd usage each time | Tools register into the harness — the AI finds and reuses them automatically |\n"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"| Changing config / switching models | Edit scripts or re-paste the Skill body | Change a field in S"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"ettings; it takes effect immediately |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"In short: **less context, ready to use, config without code**."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"The package is **dual-face**:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- **Host half** (`lib/index.js`) — a cordis plugin: registers tools on the global tools registry, lo"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ads and persists `omni-vision.json` (see Configuration), and re-syncs registration on config changes"},{"id":"p34s3","text":" — including changes made by hand while it runs. The `/omni/*` web routes are registered only where "},{"id":"p34s4","text":"a `webServer` exists (web / desktop compositions); CLI and headless compositions get the tools witho"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"ut any HTTP surface.\n- **Client half** (`lib/client.js`) — the browser module (loaded via the `dsh.c"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"lient` entry): registers the **Settings → Omni Workstation** section and its locale namespace (`sett"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"ings.omni-workstation`)."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
